Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?fix:=20rename=20COMMON=5FSPECULATIVE=5FTYPE=5FD?=
 =?UTF-8?q?FLASH=20=E2=86=92=20DRAFT=5FDFLASH?=
